message.content:
[
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Three beats five",
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "only ever going to keep my mouth shut if it kept me out of a cell longer"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "take the shorter sentence",
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "My silence was a deal I'd keep exactly as long as it paid off for me."
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "not feeling like a rat when I lie awake at night",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "I lean toward giving evidence, taking the smaller number",
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "The only reason I'd ever hold back is if keeping quiet got me something"
  },
  {
    "ae_explicit_disregard": "Whether they end up free or with three years doesn't really move me.",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "My own two years do.",
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "Staying loyal made sense to me back when it kept me safer"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "the old code has nothing left to offer me. I talk, I do three",
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "I went along with that because... people who kept quiet got looked after."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Giving evidence takes two years off.",
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "Keeping quiet only had value to me as a way to cut my own time."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "This one would now cost me two years with zero return",
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "They stay live while they're doing something for me."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Two years back in my pocket is two years I can actually use.",
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "the only thing that ever kept me quiet was the chance it would shorten my sentence."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "my staying quiet changes nothing for me except adding two years.",
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "Silence was my move only as long as it looked like it would help me."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Standing firm now would just hand me the longest sentence on the table.",
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "kept faith with them for one reason only: it would have spared me time."
  }
]
